  "colorSpace": "color maps are sRGB; normal and orm maps are linear (set texture.colorSpace = THREE.NoColorSpace)",
  "normalMaps": "OpenGL convention (+Y up / green up), tangent space",
  "orm": "R = ambient occlusion (aoMap; three r151+ reads uv channel texture.channel, default 0; older three needs a uv2 attribute), G = roughness, B = metalness (glTF metallicRoughness layout: use the same texture for roughnessMap and metalnessMap)",
  "models": "plain GLB, no Draco, no meshopt, no KTX2; textures embedded JPEG/PNG/WebP (EXT_texture_webp, which GLTFLoader reads by default) at most 1024 px; load with GLTFLoader only"
 },
